{
  "slug": "spec-first",
  "name": "Spec First",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Claude Code plugin that guides you from requirements to working code — define a spec, implement it, and generate docs, all from your terminal. Each command orchestrates specialized agents that run in parallel where possible. The spec is the contract between define and implement — no spec, no code.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **3 skills**, **1 agent** and **1 hook**.\n\n- **Skills** (3): `document` (Generate minimal documentation through parallel agents), `implement` (Implement through pattern learning), `spec` (Create specifications through parallel analysis)\n- **Agents** (1): `implement-minimal` (Write the simplest working implementation)\n- **Hooks** (1): `Stop`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install spec-first@claude-community` from `bitcraft-apps/spec-first`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 3,
    "agent": 1,
    "hook": 1
  },
  "sourceType": "community",
  "author": {
    "name": "Szymon Graczyk",
    "url": "https://github.com/bitcraft-apps"
  },
